{"unit_id":"Oscar-Williams__dsh-deepcanary#card-zh","repo":"Oscar-Williams/dsh-deepcanary","commit":"07a56658e8e6130644da68c68b57067dbe3c09c4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DeepCanary 是面向 DSH WebUI 和 Windows 桌面端的任务提醒与收件箱插件。它接入 DSH 会话和运行状态，在侧边栏提供可移动、可调整大小的面板，并将需要回答或审批、异常状态及常规任务更新整理为待处理、稍后和动态项目。用户可查看提醒详情、返回对应会话、确认处理、延后提醒或调整通知级别、静默时段与中断频率；也可通过工具读取状态和收件箱、解释规则或预览策略结果。插件使用本地规则评估会话信号，并在浏览器支持时发送通知。需要兼容的 DSH 版本；不要求额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:36-42","src/service.ts:574-593","src/client/index.ts:2368-2392","src/tools.ts:41-65"]}
{"unit_id":"Oscar-Williams__dsh-deepcanary#card-en","repo":"Oscar-Williams/dsh-deepcanary","commit":"07a56658e8e6130644da68c68b57067dbe3c09c4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DeepCanary adds a task inbox to DSH WebUI and Windows Desktop. Its sidebar groups alerts as pending, snoozed, or activity. Users can reopen sessions, acknowledge or snooze items, and set quiet hours. DSH tools expose status and policy explanations. It requires a compatible DSH host.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:36-42","src/service.ts:574-593","src/client/index.ts:2368-2392","src/tools.ts:41-65"]}
